"folder <strong>%1</strong> was rejected."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:777
msgid "Folder Listing Unavailable"
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:778
msgid "Protocol %1 is not a Filesystem"
msgstr "Протокол %1 файл тизими эмас"

#: kio/global.cpp:779
msgid ""
"This means that a request was made which requires determining the contents of "
"the folder, and the KDE program supporting this protocol is unable to do so."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:787
msgid "Cyclic Link Detected"
msgstr "Чексиз боғ топилди"

#: kio/global.cpp:788
msgid ""
"UNIX environments are commonly able to link a file or folder to a separate name "
"and/or location. KDE detected a link or series of links that results in an "
"infinite loop - i.e. the file was (perhaps in a roundabout way) linked to "
"itself."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:792 kio/global.cpp:814
msgid ""
"Delete one part of the loop in order that it does not cause an infinite loop, "
"and try again."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:801
msgid "Request Aborted By User"
msgstr "Талаб фойдаланувчи томонидан тўхтатилди"

#: kio/global.cpp:802 kio/global.cpp:1095
msgid "The request was not completed because it was aborted."
msgstr "Талаб охирига етказилмади. Чунки у тўхтатилди."

#: kio/global.cpp:804 kio/global.cpp:998 kio/global.cpp:1097
msgid "Retry the request."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:808
msgid "Cyclic Link Detected During Copy"
msgstr "Нусха кўчираётганда чексиз боғ топилди"

#: kio/global.cpp:809
msgid ""
"UNIX environments are commonly able to link a file or folder to a separate name "
"and/or location. During the requested copy operation, KDE detected a link or "
"series of links that results in an infinite loop - i.e. the file was (perhaps "
"in a roundabout way) linked to itself."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:819
msgid "Could Not Create Network Connection"
msgstr "Тармоқ орқали уланишни яратиб бўлмади"

#: kio/global.cpp:820
msgid "Could Not Create Socket"
msgstr "Сокетни яратиб бўлмади"

#: kio/global.cpp:821
msgid ""
"This is a fairly technical error in which a required device for network "
"communications (a socket) could not be created."
msgstr ""
"Бу техник хато. Тармоқ орқали алоқа учун воситани (сокет) яратиб бўлмади."

